"kirkkautensa, kun hiiren osoitin on sen yli"

#. translators: setting that when enabled makes unimportant notification less visible / darker. 'Trivial' describes favorites and boosts
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:211 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:31
