msgstr "Himmennä vähäiset ilmoitukset"

#. translators: setting subtitle that explains what dimming trivial notifications does
#: data/dev.geopjr.Tuba.gschema.xml:212 data/ui/dialogs/preferences.ui:33
msgid "Notifications like favorites and boosts will be less visible"
